      "writtenOn": "2023-01-19T04:27:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really understand how that helps, this is the manifest of the Tethering APK in the com.android.networkstack.process; not the system_server process that holds KeepaliveTracker. AFAIK Tethering doesn\u0027t back or use the keepalives so it should be unrelated.\n\nFrom discussion with Jean, Chiachang tested without and had trouble, and it works with it. Adding this shouldn\u0027t be harmful so not necessarily a blocker but we should have a bug to clarify and cleanup.",
